":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p013","text":"即位追贈散騎常侍無子弟襲以子晃繼封昇明三年與員外散騎侍郎安成戚仁祖荒人王武連羽林副彭元儁等謀反國除襲字茂德太子舍人安成太守晉安王子勛為逆襲據郡距之賊遣軍攻圍不能下太宗嘉之以為郢州刺史封建陵縣侯食邑五百戶建陵縣屬蒼梧郡以道遠改封臨澧縣侯太始六年卒於中護軍追贈護軍將軍加散騎常侍諡曰忠侯襲亦庸鄙在野州暑月露褌立聽事綱紀正伏閣怪之訪問乃知襲子旻嗣昇明三年改封東昌縣侯與兄晃俱伏誅襲弟彪祕書郎弟定太子舍人並蚤卒定弟奕海陵太守義融","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"pending","mentions":[],"source_position":{"raw_projection_ref":"source-evidence/song051-wyd1739-zongshi/transcription-projection.json","raw_file_sha256":"aa7b16d610871f77b747adbe0edb84f8775e1d404140a1e3f6284dccd11aaa45","unit_key":"unit013","source_layer":"received_chapter","first_line":117,"last_line":126},"chapter_id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi","book_id":"b-songshu-051","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi","work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-051","source_id":"s-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi","source":{"title":"宋書卷五十一，清乾隆四年武英殿本（NLC善本09753）","provider":"CBR AI direct transcription of Commons-hosted NLC scan","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=124072266","permalink":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File:NLC892-411999017142-12209_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC145%E5%86%8A.pdf&oldid=979635763","revision_id":"cbr-ai-transcription-sha256:aa7b16d610871f77b747adbe0edb84f8775e1d404140a1e3f6284dccd11aaa45","edition":"Commons著錄武英殿清乾隆4年[1739]；頁外版記親見乾隆四年校刊，非獨立刊記普查","extent":"PDF17左–39左完整卷五十一正文及史臣論；40左–41右武英殿考證。17右與41左不屬本卷，40右僅卷尾題。","text_scope":"complete_chapter","review_status":"AI_image_transcription_draft","image_verified":false,"image_verification_qualification":"AI逐頁逐列視讀；無人工全字圖校，未辨字以〓記，其他編碼仍待獨立覆核。","raw_file":"source-evidence/song051-wyd1739-zongshi/transcription-columns.txt","raw_sha256":"aa7b16d610871f77b747adbe0edb84f8775e1d404140a1e3f6284dccd11aaa45","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"extraction_note":"AI由逐頁JPEG書影轉錄；raw為本次AI逐列轉錄，不是原PDF文字抽取或PDF雜湊